  lightRegime: { key: 'THE KEY \u2014 light-sun: ONE warm-white (#FFF1D6) directional, upper front-left, modelling the hero only; 0.5 at the opening, 1.6 in full (EV-10); this room\u2019s sun casts no shadows (S1 cure C1\u2019s per-location policy)', fill: 'THE FILL \u2014 light-amb: a near-zero cold indigo wash AT FLOOR LEVEL ONLY, paired to the key at 8:1 in every state (0.0625 at the opening, 0.20 at full key); not a global ambient', rim: 'THE RIM \u2014 the gate\u2019s inlay: a cold white-violet (#B9C4FF) rim from behind the gate, owned by the inlay alone; no separate rim light exists', exhaustive: 'THE REGIME IS EXACTLY THESE THREE \u2014 the key, the fill, the rim. No other light exists in this world', emissiveCores: 'The props\u2019 emissive cores \u2014 the token\u2019s core, the claim\u2019s and the seal\u2019s glow, the marks, the world outside\u2019s own dim glow \u2014 are MATERIALS under this regime, not lights: they add no light to the scene' },
